  "helpersNote": "Helpers deform. The shoulder helper hangs under the clavicle and turns by half the upper arm's rotation, so the deltoid cap it carries follows the arm at half rate and the skin blends across the joint instead of folding at it. The twist helper hangs under the upper arm and turns by half the forearm's axial twist. semanticskeleton.ts derives both from the semantic joints; the pose generator never writes them.",
